        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kuk Harrell, Rihanna, Beyoncé, Diane Warren, Ryan Tedder, Brent Kutzle\n- Songs: Only Girl (In the World), Umbrella, I Was Here\n- Albums: Loud\n- Awards: Grammy Awards, Billboard No. 1 singles\n\nFacts:\n- \"Only Girl (In the World)\" is a song by Rihanna from her 2010 album \"Loud.\"\n- Kuk Harrell earned his fourth Grammy for the vocal production of Rihanna's Billboard No. 1 single \"Only Girl (In the World).\"\n- Kuk Harrell was the vocal producer and co-writer of Rihanna's Grammy-winning single \"Umbrella.\"\n- Diane Warren wrote the song \"I Was Here.\"\n- Ryan Tedder, Brent Kutzle, and Kuk Harrell produced the song \"I Was Here.\"\n- Beyoncé was credited for vocal production on the song \"I Was Here.\"",
